# Bopple coding rules

- TypeScript strict mode always, never use `any`
- Server components by default, `'use client'` only when needed
- Mobile-first — design for 390px width, then scale up
- Never store raw API keys or tokens — always encrypt with /lib/crypto.ts before DB write
- Never commit to main — every agent output is a PR on a new branch
- Supabase RLS on every table — users only ever see their own rows
- Every async function needs try/catch with proper error messages surfaced to user
- Hard cap task usage before running any agent job
- Use Tailwind only, no extra CSS libraries
- Dark theme throughout — bg-zinc-950, zinc-900 surfaces, zinc-800 borders
